      "preconditions": [
        "profile status=draft：只允许 plan/preflight；写阶段一律退出码 3",
        "升级 measured 必须先补齐 measurement_required 的实测值（含 expected_write_bytes / expected_md5）",
        "跨节点禁止复用 COM 映射（kb-knowledge-99ced0adc4e3）；必须传 --device-snapshot",
